   "text": "</ref><br />{{IPA|nʲiho̞ŋɡo̞}}<ref name=\\\"asahi20150305\\\">{{Cite news|url=https://www.asahi.com/articles/ASH2W5751H2WUCVL00X.html|title=「鼻濁音」来世紀ほぼ消滅？",
